Bundled data: data/snapshot.json
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The release-cycle and support data in data/snapshot.json (and in any snapshot
written by the "refresh" command) comes from endoflife.date
(https://endoflife.date), a community project that documents end-of-life dates
and support lifecycles.

  Source:          endoflife.date API v1, https://endoflife.date/api/v1/products/full
  Downloaded:      28 October 2026 (API generated_at 2026-10-28T21:19:50+00:00)
  Upstream commit: 794ba970f0e122feb390dc7e58b44522ed8b1754 of
                   https://github.com/endoflife-date/endoflife.date
                   (cross-checked against products/*.md front matter at that
                   commit: identical support dates for all 487 products)
  Changes:         trimmed to the fields this server needs (cycle, label,
                   codename, release date, LTS, end of active / security /
                   extended support, discontinued, latest version) and
                   re-serialised. Product descriptions are not included.

